text: ['Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', "Destroy target artifact. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Discard a card: Psychatog gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\nExile two cards from your graveyard: Psychatog gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Exile target creature that dealt damage to you this turn.', 'This spell costs {1} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nFireball deals X damage divided evenly, rounded down, among any number of targets.']
